────────────────────────────────────────
SECURITY & MULTI-TENANCY
────────────────────────────────────────

1) Never trust the client
- All security enforcement happens on the server.
- Client-side checks are UX-only and never authoritative.

2) Auth is mandatory
- Any route under /app/* requires authentication.
- Any API under /api/* (except /api/auth/*) requires authentication.
- Always validate the session/token inside the endpoint.

3) Tenant scoping is mandatory
- All tenant-scoped data MUST be filtered by tenantId/workspaceId.
- Never query or mutate tenant data without tenant isolation.
- Never accept tenantId from client and trust it blindly.

4) Tenant resolution
- Resolve tenant server-side using DB membership.
- Prefer a single helper to resolve the active tenant from:
  - session user
  - membership records
- Do not hardcode tenantId values.

5) Platform blocked users
- If user.isPlatformBlocked === true:
  - deny all tenant mutations
  - return 403 with a clear error code/message.

6) Cross-tenant operations
- Cross-tenant queries/mutations are forbidden unless:
  - explicitly platform-level authorized
  - implemented in dedicated admin-only endpoints.
